<title>JAPAN: Japan 10-yr JGB auction lowest price 100.20.</title>
<headline>Japan 10-yr JGB auction lowest price 100.20.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 2.6 percent 197th 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) auction, covering 60 percent of the one trillion yen issue, were as follows, the</p>
<p>Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Lowest price	 100.20   Stop rate     2.574 pct</p>
<p> Average price	100.22   Average yield 2.572 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   2.3261 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted bids	591.25 billion yen</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 93.6445 pct</p>
<p> Issue date   July 22, 1997   Maturity   Sept 20, 2007</p>
</text>
